Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.00,0:15:58.44,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.00,0:15:58.44,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}棱镜愈卫！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.15,0:07:14.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.16,0:16:04.23,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,高阔凌云的勇气！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.14,0:16:06.64,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.14,0:16:06.64,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}飞翼愈卫！
