Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.97,0:16:59.82,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.91,0:17:02.08,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.43,0:17:05.37,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.04,0:17:08.75,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.90,0:17:10.72,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.21,0:17:13.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.37,0:17:15.41,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.72,0:17:20.90,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,强者为胜...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.09,0:17:23.16,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,无力的弱小者 毫无价值
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.71,0:17:28.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,没有这回事！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.33,0:17:32.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不能以有无力量 来评价价值！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.22,0:17:34.32,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人都有各自的优点！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.50,0:17:36.41,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嘴上说的是轻巧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.80,0:17:38.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.72,0:17:40.24,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.51,0:17:43.95,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,攻击都被弹开了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.39,0:17:45.60,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.25,0:17:49.72,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我有办法
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.10,0:17:52.77,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,先这样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.94,0:17:53.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哦哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.72,0:17:54.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,再这样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.50,0:17:55.11,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,喔噢...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.27,0:17:55.82,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,最后这样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.97,0:17:57.09,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.33,0:17:58.77,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,就按这样来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.95,0:17:59.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.05,0:18:03.92,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你们想做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.62,0:18:08.89,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女·棱镜光流
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.62,0:18:08.89,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Hero Girl Prism Shot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.63,0:18:15.39,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,徒劳之举...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.19,0:18:18.85,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.34,0:18:22.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,走你！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.81,0:18:26.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,用回旋来弹开攻击的话 只要停止回旋！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.24,0:18:29.76,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,瞄准... 扣球！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.35,0:18:39.04,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.53,0:18:40.85,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,别做梦！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.14,0:18:45.41,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.32,0:18:48.69,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶暴暴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.86,0:18:49.79,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.99,0:18:50.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
